Generation 3 data provenance
============================

The generated reference-data snapshot is derived from the resolved Generation 3
Dex of Pokémon Showdown, distributed as the npm package pokemon-showdown.

Upstream project: https://github.com/smogon/pokemon-showdown
Package version: 0.11.11
Source git commit: 739a5e1fee432ad80ff7136d70cca993be358b59
Dex mod: gen3

The repository's tools/data-import/source-lock.json records the source tarball
and integrity pin. The generated data/manifest.json accompanies the snapshot.
The import process projects selected JSON metadata and preserves relevant
Generation 3 learnset provenance. It does not ship the upstream battle simulator
or its executable behavior callbacks in this package.

